BionicI18n.register("en",{"components.beta25.help.series":"In Tools, choose from 1 to 5 images. Prompts are prepared in one call, then rendered in a shared queue of up to twelve images. Each card has its own tracking.","components.beta25.help.policy":"Keep allows another conversation during rendering. Respond between images keeps the model loaded and interleaves text. Unload frees text models for the batch; their next load takes time.","components.beta25.help.actions":"Cancel an image still queued locally or retry a finished image with the same or a different seed. Deliverables → Generation collects project images; select up to 20 for a ZIP. Check an uncertain submission before resuming the queue."});
